  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Sustainable Cocoa Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">S. Obj. 2 - make agriculture forestry and fisheries more productive and sustainable with a special emphasis on Outcome 2.1 which focuses on sustainably increasing productivity while addressing climate change and environmental degradation that will be achieved through the adoption of sustainable practices and production systems that promote climate change adaptation and mitigation and prevent natural resources degradation. S. Obj. 3 - reduce rural poverty with emphasis on Outcome 3.2 which aims at facilitating income diversification in the context of rural transformations and climate change adaptation and mitigation, strengthened component of rural poor inclusion in specific value chains and markets. S. Obj. 4 - enable inclusive and efficient agricultural and food system with a special emphasis on Outcome 4.3 which focuses on strengthening the managerial and technical capacities of those involved in value chain activities, and of the providers of support services such as investment and finance.</narrative>
  </description>
